//? Title: Kahn topological sort: actual FIFO sources and blocked cycles
//? Subtitle: Actual canonical histories, retained original fixtures and explicit controls
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
Kahn emits ready sources and removes their outgoing prerequisites. Actual FIFO
decisions, indegree changes and partial progress retain the original six-course
curriculum while diagnosing cyclic leftovers accurately.
)

\toc

> Mechanism and mathematical scope

Seed sources in increasing vertex ID order, then process a FIFO queue. Each
emitted source decrements every outgoing edge, enqueuing a successor exactly
when its remaining indegree reaches0. A DAG emits all vertices; fewer emissions
prove a directed cycle exists. Remaining blocked vertices may also be
descendants of cycles, so they are not all cycle members. Fixed edge-list order
is deterministic but does not imply a globally lexicographically minimal order.
Duplicate edges are counted and removed separately. O(V+E) producing work and
owned graph/queue storage.

> A tiny actual producing history

The table and native concept diagram read the same producing execution. Every
block below is a complete editable C++ program.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/topological_sort_tiny.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
#include <filesystem>
#include <print>
#include <algorithm>
#include <cmath>
#include <limits>
#include <numeric>
#include <numbers>
#include <random>
#include <string>
#include <vector>
#include <map>
#include <set>
#include <array>
#include <tuple>
#include <bit>
#include <datamunge/random/quality.hpp>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/topological_sort.hpp>
int main() {
    namespace a = dm::algorithms;
    namespace g = dm::graphics;
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
    auto r = a::topological_sort_trace(4, {{0, 2}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}});
    std::print("| actual action | node | other | indegree before | after | ready queue size | emitted |\n| " "--- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n");
    for (const auto &s : r.steps)
        std::print("| {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} |\n", s.action, s.vertex,
                   s.other, s.degree_before, s.degree_after, s.ready, s.emitted);
    g::Diagram concept_diagram(48, 1100);
    concept_diagram.node("n0", {0, 0}, "Actual two sources0 and1");
    concept_diagram.node("n1", {5, 0},
                         std::format("{} actual successor decrements",
                                     r.edge_visits));
    concept_diagram.node("n2", {10, 0},
                         std::format("Actual complete order {}", r.result.order));
    concept_diagram.edge("n0", "n1").edge("n1", "n2");
    concept_diagram.save_svg("build/topological_sort_tiny.svg");
}
```
