| 8 | 8 | 7 | 8 |
| 32 | 32 | 31 | 32 |
| 128 | 128 | 127 | 128 |
| 512 | 512 | 511 | 512 |
| 2048 | 2048 | 2047 | 2048 |
\image(figures/topological_sort_work.svg)
